{"3883040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Animal Mystery Crew", "steam_appid": 3883040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883040/extras/12baee54e6353cefd9352fd2d23e54dd.avif?t=1768133465\" width=968 height=233 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <strong>Detective Ron Soco</strong>'s boots as he struggles to get The <strong>Animal Mystery Crew</strong> up and running. Animal Mystery Crew is a <strong>casual detective adventure game</strong> focusing on a <strong>surreal</strong> and <strong>absurdist</strong> <strong>narrative</strong> style. <strong>Investigate</strong> the peculiar mysteries spread throughout Ribot Park and <strong>solve</strong> stories so wild they're wilder than your wildest dreams (At least they should be).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Talk to everyone!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883040/extras/b514942d6b242e62933bf9743883d71d.poster.avif?t=1768133465\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883040/extras/b514942d6b242e62933bf9743883d71d.webm?t=1768133465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883040/extras/b514942d6b242e62933bf9743883d71d.mp4?t=1768133465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883040/extras/7ef2053fa8f4547b37dafd4960890f37.avif?t=1768133465\" width=314 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world inhabited by Animals, <i>no two cases are the same</i>. In this <strong>non-linear, cosy detective game</strong>, gather evidence and use the power of deduction to <strong>interrogate</strong> the poor citizens found in the park. Catch the bad guys and etch Ron Soco's name into the detective's hall of fame. Be careful about choosing your culprit, <i>seriously, false imprisonment is no joke.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883040/extras/84930f5e239d79eff5d7fa66c3340f08.avif?t=1768133465\" width=400 height=407 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Gather up your evidence!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883040/extras/3bffebd97537466c97b256d2ccb9009d.poster.avif?t=1768133465\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883040/extras/3bffebd97537466c97b256d2ccb9009d.webm?t=1768133465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883040/extras/3bffebd97537466c97b256d2ccb9009d.mp4?t=1768133465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTENT WARNING:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is quite strange in places. Don't play if you get freaked out by dentures or something.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com